# Half Adder

A Verilog implementation of a Half Adder that performs binary addition of two single-bit inputs and produces sum and carry outputs. All input combinations (00, 01, 10, 11) are verified through simulation.

## Inputs / Outputs
- Inputs: A, B  
- Outputs: SUM, CARRY  

## Files
- `half_adder.v` — RTL design  
- `half_adder_tb.v` — Testbench  

## Functionality
- SUM = A ⊕ B  
- CARRY = A · B  

## Simulation
Simulated using Xilinx Vivado. Waveforms confirm correct operation for all input combinations, verifying proper sum and carry generation.
